The art in this folder (A Link to the Past's sprites and map) is Nintendo's:
The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past is a trademark of Nintendo, and its
art belongs to Nintendo. It is used here, as the tracker's README credits it,
to show the game's own items on a fan-made tracker.

- The item, boss and dungeon sprites came with the original tracker,
  TestRunnerSRL/lttp-tracker (MIT, notice below).
- dungeonmap.png and compass.png come from hutchch/ALTTPR-Tracker at 55a838e
  (MIT, notice below).
- triforce.png is the Triforce piece of z3randomizer's data/customitems.png,
  KatDevsGames/z3randomizer at dcb0a2b42d14445f7994a0e9e4d63cbecf4b98d3
  (MIT, notice below).
- bottle-empty.png, bottle-red.png, bottle-green.png, bottle-blue.png,
  bottle-fairy.png, bottle-bee.png, bottle-goodbee.png and bottle-mushroom.png
  are the game's own sprites, taken from its item menu as the randomized game
  draws it.
- The dungeon counters' digits, the "?" medallion and prize, the 5/6 crystal,
  both boomerangs at once, the retro shops and the hearts counter are the
  tracker's own, under the project's licence (../../../../LICENSE).

The smz3 folder carries its own licence.

